      "settings": {
        "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Case Grupo Boticário — Hyper Island</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n/* ===== CSS VARIABLES — LIGHT THEME ===== */\n:root {\n  --hi-black: #F5F4F0;        /* page background: warm off-white */\n  --hi-white: #111110;        /* primary text: near-black */\n  --hi-orange: #FF7300;\n  --hi-orange-light: #FF8C00;\n  --hi-gray: #ECEAE4;         /* card/section backgrounds */\n  --hi-gray-mid: #D4D1C8;     /* borders */\n  --hi-gray-light: #888580;   /* muted labels */\n  --hi-gray-pale: #444240;    /* body text */\n  --hi-accent: #2A2927;       /* darker text accent */\n\n  --font-heading: 'ABC Gravity', 'Barlow Condensed', 'Oswald', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n  --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n  --spacing-md: 2rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 8rem;\n}\n\n/* ===== RESET ===== */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n/* ===== BASE ===== */\nbody {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n/* ===== FONT FALLBACK FOR ABC GRAVITY ===== */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'ABC Gravity';\n  src: local('ABC Gravity');\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4, .label {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n}\n\n/* ===== HERO ===== */\n.case-hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.hero-video-container {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-video-container video {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0.55;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    transparent 0%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 40%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 75%,\n    #0A0A0A 100%\n  );\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.case-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.case-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo img {\n  height: 36px;\n  width: auto;\n  filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 6rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\n.hero-title em {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n\n.hero-meta-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.meta-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n.meta-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n/* ===== SCROLL INDICATOR ===== */\n.scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator span {\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.scroll-line {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hi-orange), transparent);\n  animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }\n}\n\n/* ===== INTRO SECTION ===== */\n.intro-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.intro-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.intro-body p:first-child {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--hi-accent);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.intro-body p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* ===== STATS BAND ===== */\n.stats-band {\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.stats-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.stat-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #0A0A0A;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.stat-desc {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.65);\n}\n\n/* ===== TIMELINE SECTIONS ===== */\n.timeline-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.timeline-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n  padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.timeline-year {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.timeline-year.active {\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--hi-orange);\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n.timeline-header-content {\n  padding-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-tag {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== CONTENT GRID ===== */\n.content-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-grid.two-col {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n}\n\n.content-grid.text-image {\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-grid.image-text {\n  grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-text p {\n  font-size: 0.975rem;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n.content-text strong {\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.content-text h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n/* ===== QUOTE BLOCK ===== */\n.quote-block {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.quote-block::before {\n  content: '\"';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -1rem;\n  right: var(--spacing-md);\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.1;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.quote-text {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-style: italic;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* ===== MEDIA COMPONENTS ===== */\n.media-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-image.portrait {\n  aspect-ratio: 3/4;\n}\n\n.media-image.wide {\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n}\n\n.media-video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-caption {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  padding: 0.5rem 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== PHOTO GALLERY ===== */\n.photo-gallery {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-masonry {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n}\n\n.gallery-item {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n.gallery-item.span-2 {\n  grid-column: span 2;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n}\n\n.gallery-item img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n}\n\n.gallery-item:hover img {\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n}\n\n/* ===== APPROACH PILLS ===== */\n.approach-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.approach-item {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.approach-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 3rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content h4 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n/* ===== HIGHLIGHT BOX ===== */\n.highlight-box {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.highlight-box::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.highlight-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.highlight-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== DIVIDER ===== */\n.section-divider {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.section-divider hr {\n  border: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== VIDEO SECTION ===== */\n.video-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.video-section-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.video-section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  max-width: 500px;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.video-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.video-item video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.video-item-caption {\n  padding: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n}\n\n/* ===== CLOSING SECTION ===== */\n.closing-section {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.closing-section::before {\n  content: 'HYPER\\AISLAND';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -2rem;\n  right: -1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 10rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  white-space: pre;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.closing-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.closing-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.closing-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-text {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n.cta-block {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.cta-block-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.cta-block p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.75);\n}\n\n.cta-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n}\n\n.cta-button:hover { background: #333; }\n\n/* ===== FULL-WIDTH IMAGE BREAK ===== */\n.fullwidth-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-height: 600px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  :root {\n    --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n    --spacing-xl: 4rem;\n  }\n\n  .intro-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .intro-sidebar { position: static; }\n  .intro-number { font-size: 5rem; }\n\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .content-grid.two-col,\n  .content-grid.text-image,\n  .content-grid.image-text { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .photo-gallery.grid-masonry { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .video-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .closing-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .timeline-header { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .timeline-year { font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem); }\n\n  .hero-meta { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-masonry,\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .gallery-item.span-2 { grid-column: span 2; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n  .hero-meta { gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n}\n\n/* ===== ANIMATION ON SCROLL ===== */\n.fade-up {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(30px);\n  transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\n}\n\n.fade-up.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* ===== TAGS / SKILL BADGES ===== */\n.skill-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;\n}\n\n.skill-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.skill-badge.orange {\n  border-color: var(--hi-orange);\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  background: rgba(255,115,0,0.06);\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"case-hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-video-container\">\n    <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\">\n      <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/8c2cafdc9792491297b222d119924b30.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    </source></video>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"case-label\">Case de Transformação</div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-client-logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%2060'%3E%3Ctext%20y='48'%20font-family='Arial'%20font-weight='bold'%20font-size='52'%20fill='white'%3EGrupoBotic%C3%A1rio%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Grupo Boticário\">\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Quando o<br><em>desenvolvimento</em><br>começa pela escuta</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Cliente</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Grupo Boticário</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Período</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">2022 – 2025</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Área</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Supply Chain</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Parceria Estratégica</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">\n    <div class=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n    <span>Scroll</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"intro-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"intro-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"intro-number\">GB</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-label\">Sobre o projeto</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-title\">Diagnóstico.<br>Co-criação.<br>Escala.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-body\">\n    <p>Antes de desenvolver qualquer pessoa, a Hyper Island quis entender. Essa escolha define tudo o que veio depois na parceria com o Grupo Boticário — e é o que transforma esse case em algo mais do que um programa de treinamento bem executado.</p>\n    <p>A área de Supply Chain do Grupo Boticário tem 300 profissionais. É uma operação de alta complexidade, em constante crescimento, atravessando um momento de mudanças e aquisições que colocava pressão sobre líderes e times ao mesmo tempo.</p>\n    <p>Quando a Hyper Island foi convidada para atuar nesse contexto, em 2023, a primeira decisão foi não começar pelas respostas.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Power Skills</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Liderança</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Cultura de Dados</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Supply Chain</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Transformação Cultural</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Facilitação</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== STATS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">300+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Profissionais na área de Supply Chain</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">39</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Entrevistas qualitativas realizadas</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">90%</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Taxa de participação no diagnóstico</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">NPS 70</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Encontro anual de líderes VP B2C</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== FULL WIDTH IMAGE ==================== -->\n<img class=\"fullwidth-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/FOTO_GB_DIA_2_TIME_COMPLETO_3.png?v=1777576477\" alt=\"Time completo Grupo Boticário – Dia 2\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<!-- ==================== TIMELINE: 2023 ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year active\">2023</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Diagnóstico</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Ouvir antes<br>de propor</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>O trabalho começou com um <strong>diagnóstico profundo das Power Skills</strong> da área, conduzido de julho a novembro de 2023, com três facilitadores da Hyper Island dedicados ao processo.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">01</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Curadoria Internacional</h4>\n            <p>Mapeamento das habilidades do futuro com base nas principais referências globais sobre competências essenciais para o próximo ciclo.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">02</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>39 Entrevistas Qualitativas</h4>\n            <p>Sessões de escuta profunda com membros do time, exigindo disponibilidade, atenção aos detalhes e capacidade de interpretar o que estava sendo dito nas entrelinhas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">03</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Questionário de Autoavaliação</h4>\n            <p>Respondido por 90% da equipe de Supply Chain — um índice de participação que por si só já diz algo sobre o engajamento do time com o processo.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8839.jpg?v=1777574932\" alt=\"Sessão de diagnóstico\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8500.jpg?v=1777574932\" alt=\"Grupo Boticário workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6202.jpg?v=1777574931\" alt=\"Grupo Boticário workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8734.jpg?v=1777574930\" alt=\"Grupo Boticário workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== TIMELINE: 2024 ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\">2024</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Desenvolvimento</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Programa que parte<br>de onde a área<br>realmente está</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid image-text\">\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8661.jpg?v=1777574932\" alt=\"Programa 2024\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>Com as quatro habilidades prioritárias definidas e legitimadas, o desenvolvimento pôde começar com uma vantagem rara: <strong>foco</strong>.</p>\n      <p>Em vez de trabalhar um repertório genérico de liderança, o programa de 2024 foi desenhado especificamente para ampliar visão estratégica, influência e capacidade de decisão em contextos complexos — com forte conexão aos desafios concretos do Supply Chain.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin: 1.5rem 0;\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">O que o programa respondeu</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Liderar significa tomar decisões com dados incompletos, navegar interdependências e manter a operação funcionando enquanto o ambiente muda.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>O programa foi construído para responder a essas realidades específicas — e não a uma versão abstrata do que é liderança.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-masonry\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item span-2\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6184.jpg?v=1777574929\" alt=\"Workshop Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_5497.jpg?v=1777574928\" alt=\"Facilitação Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_7073.jpg?v=1777574928\" alt=\"Treinamento Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== TIMELINE: 2025 ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\">2025</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Escala</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Do aprendizado<br>para a prática</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid two-col\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Aprofundamento das Lideranças</h3>\n      <p>O terceiro ano trouxe foco explícito na <strong>transição entre aprender e aplicar</strong>. Sessões de planejamento, trocas de experiência e workshops práticos foram desenhados com um critério claro: tudo precisava ser diretamente aplicável com as equipes, no dia seguinte.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Facilitação de Reuniões</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Storytelling</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Conversas Difíceis</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>Facilitar reuniões pode parecer uma habilidade menor — até você perceber quantas horas são desperdiçadas em alinhamentos que não alinham nada.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Escala para toda a área</h3>\n      <p>Enquanto as lideranças aprofundavam a prática, cerca de <strong>350 colaboradores</strong> da área de Supply Chain passaram pelo desenvolvimento nas mesmas quatro habilidades prioritárias.</p>\n      <p>O objetivo era criar uma <strong>linguagem comum entre todos os níveis</strong> — para que o trabalho desenvolvido nas lideranças encontrasse eco em toda a equipe.</p>\n      <div class=\"quote-block\">\n        <p class=\"quote-text\">Quando toda a área compartilha o mesmo vocabulário, a mudança se torna coletiva e se sustenta com muito mais consistência.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-masonry\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6161.jpg?v=1777574928\" alt=\"Treinamento equipe\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item span-2\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6940.jpg?v=1777574927\" alt=\"Workshop em grupo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8641.jpg?v=1777574925\" alt=\"Colaboradores Grupo Boticário\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== DATA TRACK ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25)\">+</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Trilha Paralela</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Liderança orientada<br>por dados</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>Em paralelo ao programa principal, a Hyper Island foi acionada para trabalhar um desafio específico da área de Suprimentos: <strong>avançar no uso de dados para além do técnico</strong>.</p>\n      <p>O resultado foi um treinamento intensivo de um dia, construído na interseção entre dados, mindset e comportamento de liderança.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Big Data &amp; Vieses Cognitivos</h4>\n            <p>Conexão entre dados e as armadilhas mentais que interferem na interpretação.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Modelo Cynefin</h4>\n            <p>Resolução de problemas complexos com frameworks adaptados ao contexto real.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Narrativa para Stakeholders</h4>\n            <p>Construção de histórias claras com dados para influenciar decisões estratégicas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8645.jpg?v=1777574924\" alt=\"Treinamento de dados\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Cultura mais analítica, colaborativa e orientada a impacto.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== VIDEO SECTION ==================== -->\n<div class=\"video-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"video-section-header\">\n    <div class=\"video-section-title\">O programa em movimento</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.7rem; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--hi-gray-light);\">Registros em vídeo</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"video-grid\">\n    <div class=\"video-item\">\n      <video controls=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_8839.jpg?v=1777574932\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/8c2cafdc9792491297b222d119924b30.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"video-item\">\n      <video controls=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6202.jpg?v=1777574931\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/f1bfac5019134949aa741f7453d28544.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CLOSING ==================== -->\n<section class=\"closing-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"closing-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"closing-label\">O que essa parceria revela</div>\n      <h2 class=\"closing-title\">Adaptação<br>com consistência<br>metodológica</h2>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\">\n        Olhando para o arco completo — desde os trainees de 2022 até a escala para 350 colaboradores em 2025 — o que se torna evidente é uma forma específica de construir parceria. A Hyper Island não entrou no Grupo Boticário com um catálogo de programas. Entrou com capacidade de escuta, rigor metodológico e disposição para co-criar soluções que fizessem sentido dentro daquele contexto específico.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        Essa capacidade de adaptação, mantendo a consistência metodológica, é o que transforma uma entrega pontual em uma parceria que dura e que cresce.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cta-block\">\n      <div class=\"cta-block-title\">Quer construir uma parceria assim?</div>\n      <p>Cada organização tem desafios únicos. Nossa abordagem começa pela escuta — sempre.</p>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"cta-button\">Fale com um especialista</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== SCROLL ANIMATION ==================== -->\n<script>\n(function() {\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n      if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n        entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n      }\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -60px 0px' });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n})();\n</script>",
